From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Doug Goldstein <cardoe@cardoe.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 09:25:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(neutron): use the right image and security context
 for the OVN agents

The neutron-ovn-agent and neutron-ovn-metadata-agent daemonsets were
copied from daemonset-metadata-agent.yaml and never fully renamed, so
they pulled images.tags.neutron_metadata and read the non-OVN metadata
agent's security context. Point them at their own values.yaml keys and
fix the init container names the AppArmor annotations already expected.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5
Signed-off-by: Doug Goldstein <cardoe@cardoe.com>
Change-Id: I2fdb59f1a119ae9c8d406f16229c10d51bbaf3db
(cherry picked from commit ba117e4869e8306d636ff86ec6bf0180df113129)
